# Docker build context exclusions (F15 packaging).
#
# Keep the context small AND avoid clobbering in-container build output:
#   - `web/dist` is produced by the `web` stage (`npm run build`); the host copy
#     must never be copied in.
#   - `web/node_modules` is installed in the `web` stage (`npm ci`); copying the
#     host copy would clobber the correct, lockfile-pinned tree.
#   - `target/` is produced by the `builder` stage.
# The `web/` *source* (package.json, package-lock.json, src, configs) IS kept.

# Rust build artifacts
target/

# Frontend build artifacts & dependencies (built inside their stages)
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/

# VCS / local state / secrets
.git/
.gitignore
data/
.env
.env.*

# Docs, plans and packaging files not needed inside the image
plans/
docs/
*.md
Dockerfile
Containerfile
compose.yaml
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.yaml
.dockerignore
